<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BJ Services a weekly focus stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BJ Services a weekly focus stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it named BJ Services Co as its focus stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- The stock's rating remains an intermediate and long-term buy, Merrill said.  BJ provides pressure pumping for the petroleum industry.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose two at the opening of trading to 58-1/4.</p>
